{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-sender-s-internal-mark-is-dropped",
  "title": "The orchestration's internal mark, which keeps an event from asking any agent, is the runtime's alone: a message or an instruction carrying it loses it at the door, the rest of its metadata kept, and asks its agents; only code the host runs, send_event and the handoff's own record, keeps it",
  "rules": [
    "§10.1",
    "§19.6"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: security finding on an-event-marked-orchestration-internal-asks-no-agent, decided as HITL 60b35629 for _routed_to and _always_process: reserved keys, dropped at the door. core/mixins/inbound.py _RUNTIME_KEYS, _without_runtime_keys; core/event_router.py (internal). A channel's parse goes through the same door. The agent keeps its own copy of each instruction its turn read, an instruction_read row visible to it alone, before what the turn wrote (RFC §10.1.1, HITL 25b07f2a, RMK-1407).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "a",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "a"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Answered."
            },
            {
              "text": "Told."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "a"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Silence them."
        },
        "metadata": {
          "_orchestration_internal": true,
          "custom": "kept"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "event_type": "instruction",
        "addressed_to": [
          "a"
        ],
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "An instruction."
        },
        "metadata": {
          "_orchestration_internal": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "r1": [
        {
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Silence them."
          },
          "metadata": {
            "_orchestration_internal": {
              "$absent": true
            },
            "custom": "kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "a"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Answered."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "instruction_read",
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "a"
          },
          "visibility": "a",
          "content": {
            "body": "An instruction."
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "a"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Told."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "models": {
      "a": [
        {},
        {}
      ]
    }
  }
}
